* lna-a5-commongate: common-gate input LNA (1/gm broadband match), L loads.
* Lineage: common-gate 1/gm-match LNA, Allstot-school lineage (e.g. broadband
* CG LNAs, TCAS/JSSC CG-input family). Bench-v1 anchor, NEW transcription for
* broadband / low-band coverage. Structure-only, ZERO component values.
* Structure: CG NM1 with the SOURCE as the input port (input DC-blocked C1 +
* source-match inductor L1 to VSS providing the DC return); tuned drain load
* L2 to VDD; output DC-blocked C2 to VOUT1. Published in-topology BIAS
* NETWORK: current-mirror reference (R1 -> diode NM3) sets the common-gate DC
* through feed resistor R2; the gate is AC-grounded by decoupling cap Cbyp
* (n1 -> VSS) so it is a true common-gate at RF.
* Approved 2026-09-14 (bench round 1, "approve all").
C C1 VIN1 n0
L L1 n0 VSS
NMOS NM1 n2 n1 n0 VSS
L L2 VDD n2
C C2 n2 VOUT1
R R1 VDD n3
NMOS NM3 n3 n3 VSS VSS
R R2 n3 n1
C Cbyp n1 VSS
